* text=auto eol=lf

*.parquet binary
*.csv.gz binary
*.csv text eol=lf

# Deterministic script output -- GitHub should not compute language stats
# nor a "human" diff over these. data/analysis/*.parquet and *.csv.gz are
# tracked since DECISIONS.md ADR-0014; the blanket `*.parquet`/`*.csv.gz`
# binary rule above already covers them, and this just marks them generated
# too, the same way data/derived/ already is.
data/derived/** linguist-generated
data/analysis/*.parquet linguist-generated
data/analysis/*.csv.gz linguist-generated
docs/dicionario.md linguist-generated

# data/external/*.csv is NOT marked linguist-generated, on purpose: it is
# human judgment (the node map, each merger's date, each code's class), and
# its diff is exactly what needs to stay reviewable in a pull request.
